---
description: Gameplay data lives in public/data JSON; src/config is layout only
globs:
  - public/data/**
  - src/core/DataStore.ts
  - src/core/normalize*.ts
  - src/core/dataFieldsDoc.test.ts
  - src/config/**
  - src/content/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Gameplay numbers belong in `public/data/*.json`, loaded at Boot through `DataStore`. Missing required fields must throw `ConfigLoadError`; no TypeScript fallbacks.
- `src/config/` is canvas, HUD layout and render depths only.
- Per-enemy `combat` blocks live on each `enemies.json` row. Behavior id maps to `src/ai/behaviors/`.
- Adding or renaming a boot-required field means updating `public/data/DATA_FIELDS.md` in the same change.
- Spell ids stay in `src/content/spells.ts`; numeric spell tuning is in `spells.json` and `spell_input.json`.
